<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '24px 64px 0' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 96, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>
            FDE × 主数据：<span style={{ color: '#FA4F24' }}>合并与拆分必须可逆</span>
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#8A8F99', marginTop: 8 }}>
            主数据是唯一「动错了会静默出错」的地方。FDE 在现场做主数据，第一原则是留退路
        </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E8E8E8' }} />

    <Box style={{ paddingTop: 20, paddingBottom: 14, height: 479, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 13 }}>

        {/* 上：四个特有处理 */}
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 11 }}>
            {[
                { k: '实体解析', c: '#FA4F24', d: '在真数据上判断哪些是同一个。规则、相似度、人工确认三样都要有。' },
                { k: '合并可逆', c: '#E0641E', d: '合并前留快照，合并后写映射表，随时能拆回去。' },
                { k: '拆分谨慎', c: '#C43A17', d: '拆分会断掉所有历史链接。拆之前必须问业务方。' },
                { k: '金规则', c: '#A83310', d: '主键策略当场定死，改一次就是全量返工。' },
            ].map((x) => (
                <Box key={x.k} style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F7F8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '0 15px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderTop: `3px solid ${x.c}` }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: x.c }}>{x.k}</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#3A4050', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 11, flex: 1 }}>{x.d}</Text>
                </Box>
            ))}
        </Box>

        {/* 中：现场三步合并法 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 186, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 468, background: '#0F1423', borderRadius: 4, padding: '0 18px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#FBA15C', letterSpacing: 2 }}>现场合并三步法</Text>
                {[
                    { k: '一备', v: '合并前把两条原始记录整条快照存下来' },
                    { k: '二映', v: '写映射表：旧主键 → 新主键，一条不少' },
                    { k: '三认', v: '让业务方抽查十组，确认合对了' },
                ].map((x) => (
                    <Box key={x.k} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginTop: 11, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FBA15C', width: 48 }}>{x.k}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.85)', lineHeight: 1.4, flex: 1 }}>{x.v}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
                <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(250,79,36,0.22)', borderRadius: 3, padding: '0 12px', marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#FBA15C', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                        少做第一步，客户半年后想拆回来就拆不回了。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFF3EE', borderRadius: 4, borderLeft: '4px solid #FA4F24', padding: '0 17px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C43A17' }}>AI 时代主数据的新含义</Text>
                {[
                    { k: '主数据即事实', v: 'Agent 的推理必须基于唯一主数据，否则归因不了' },
                    { k: '主数据即训练集', v: '错的主数据会持续污染每一次问答' },
                    { k: '主数据即置信度', v: '合并越草率，整套 AI 越不可信' },
                ].map((x) => (
                    <Box key={x.k} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 11, marginTop: 11, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C43A17', width: 92 }}>{x.k}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#3A4050', lineHeight: 1.4, flex: 1 }}>{x.v}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* 下：现场动作 */}
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'stretch' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 208, background: '#F7F7F8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '0 15px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#8A8F99' }}>现场四步</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423', marginTop: 5, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>动手之前先问业务方</Text>
            </Box>
            {[
                { k: '定金规则', v: '当场定主键策略' },
                { k: '跑解析', v: '先跑不合并，只出候选' },
                { k: '人确认', v: '业务方抽查确认' },
                { k: '留退路', v: '快照与映射表同时落' },
            ].map((x) => (
                <Box key={x.k} style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F7F8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '0 14px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C43A17' }}>{x.k}</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#3A4050', lineHeight: 1.35, marginTop: 5 }}>{x.v}</Text>
                </Box>
            ))}
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E8E8E8' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 14, height: 14, background: '#FA4F24' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8F99', marginLeft: 12 }}>硕磐机密 · FDE咨询方法论</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8F99', marginLeft: 'auto' }}>47 / 60</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>